    "derived: each stat is base + per_level * level + sum(weight * soft(attribute)). soft() counts attribute points at",
    "full value up to 20, then at 0.75 up to 40, then at 0.35 (STA-05's soft caps).",
    "Damage per type: attack * attack / (attack + defence), then times (1 - absorb); never below min_fraction of the attack (CMB-37).",
    "Enemies list their own level, HP, attack, defence, poise and XP. Levels follow STA-10: the Vale is 1-5.",
    "Armor pieces list per-type physical defence (slash/strike/pierce) and elemental absorb (ARS-06).",
